    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d829">

                <pb facs="0973" n="879" sameAs="frus:frus1896/pg879"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Terrell to Mr. Olney.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States.</hi><lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Constantinople</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1896-02-05"><hi rendition="#italic">February 5, 1896</hi></date>.
                        (Received Feb. 24.)</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 799.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have to inform you that the inclosed is
                    an extract taken from a letter just received from the Rev. C. F. Gates, mailed
                    at Harpoot on January 15, in which he states that his original estimate of loss
                    by fire, which was $100,000, was more accurate than the one subsequently sent
                    me.</p>
                <p>I will inform the Porte that more recent information may increase the claim for
                    indemnity already made.</p>
                <p>I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">A. W. Terrell.</hi></signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d829-a1.xml" xpointer="d829-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
